      "post_id": "580326744357515264",
      "text": "Here is the speed and altitude graph of #4U9525 from @flightradar24. Scary stuff, shows it impacted ground at 400kts http://t.co/2ZYbh4MIih",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:14:12 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580327764101849088",
      "text": "@vallejocham @elespanolcom @flightradar24 going by that graph, yes. As you know, The Alps are in that area",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:18:15 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803276302448435e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580328073800871937",
      "text": "The really scary thing -as in all plane crashes- is that they fell during close to ten minutes @marshall_mcf @flightradar24 @elespanolcom",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:19:29 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803267443575153e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580333412436836352",
      "text": "@zeidlos @marshall_mcf @CalumJamesSmith though finding the cause cause save many more",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:40:42 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803332962042511e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580327994876641280",
      "text": "@marshall_mcf - I guess, only time will tell!!",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:19:10 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803278991333089e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580328282677243904",
      "text": "@marshall_mcf @elespanolcom @flightradar24 I know, but think it is too soon (and still too little data) as to reach those conclusions",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:20:19 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803277641018491e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580330278574534656",
      "text": "@JimboBohan @marshall_mcf @CalumJamesSmith Yes, this looks like someone was exchanging altitude for speed, as if there was no thrust.",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:28:15 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803293166025114e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580327566034255874",
      "text": "Molt heavy la grafica “@marshall_mcf: Here is the speed and altitude graph of #4U9525 from @flightradar24.  http://t.co/ha60q56cgN”",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:17:28 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803267443575153e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580355531224813568",
      "text": "@marshall_mcf @rodolfo_canet @flightradar24 @elespanolcom for the love of god,stop saying \"would of\",it's \"would HAVE\" it's driving me mad:D",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 13:08:35 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803285379299738e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580330532355108864",
      "text": "@zeidlos @jimbobohan @calumjamessmith very strange though. The chance of BOTH engines failing on an A320 is ~3 trillion",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:29:15 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803302785745347e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580329207638540288",
      "text": "@CalumJamesSmith @marshall_mcf youre an idiot. they were in radio contact with ATC and called out mayday moments before impact.",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:23:59 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803274753617838e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580333296204251136",
      "text": "@marshall_mcf @JimboBohan @CalumJamesSmith There are many sources of failure. However speculating won't bring back those who died. #RIP",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:40:14 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803305323551089e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580328402634309632",
      "text": "@vallejocham @elespanolcom @flightradar24 we can't speculate the cause of the crash but we know for sure the altitude and speed",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:20:47 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803282826772439e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580327383170940930",
      "text": "@vallejocham @elespanolcom @flightradar24 you can. 400kts was the last recorded speed of the aircraft",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:16:44 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803272885558927e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580333436721897472",
      "text": "@zeidlos @jimbobohan @calumjamessmith exactly. Yes, speculating won't help but Twitter is a place which allows people to do so",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:40:48 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803332962042511e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580327899133308928",
      "text": "@calumjamessmith it wouldn't do that unless the captain (who would of had to be conscious) did it himself",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:18:47 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803277850775675e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580327671483224064",
      "text": "@calumjamessmith no. If that was the case the aircraft would of continued past Dusseldorf (as it would of had the fuel onboard to do so)",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:17:53 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803274753617838e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580327630244843521",
      "text": "@marshall_mcf @elespanolcom @flightradar24 so the plane crashed at about 5,000 ft?",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:17:43 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803273831709409e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580333861063802881",
      "text": "@vallejocham @marshall_mcf @elespanolcom @flightradar24 above sealevel, yes?  It crashed in the Alps..",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:42:29 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803276302448435e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580327953806000128",
      "text": "@calumjamessmith A320's don't just randomly dive into mountains",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:19:00 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803277850775675e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580331977158574080",
      "text": "@marshall_mcf @zeidlos @CalumJamesSmith something caused him to descend.",
